{"id":"n25953-1-7","stage":2,"title":"주방 · 厨房","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25953-1-7-1","ko":"주방 쪽에서 맛있는 냄새가 나는데?","zh":"厨房那边飘来好香的味道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주방","meaning":"厨房","explanation":"주방：厨房","readings":[{"term":"주방","audio":"/audio/cd98cb9b809dd04158c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25953","senseId":"1","lemma":"주방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주방","audio":"/audio/cd98cb9b809dd04158c4.mp3"}},{"text":"쪽에서","meaning":"边","explanation":"쪽：边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪽에서","audio":"/audio/ad018b6d8902a806df8d.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있는","audio":"/audio/5adc05669a4242e46918.mp3"}},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄새가","audio":"/audio/355d1601ad77a55c071d.mp3"}},{"text":"나는데?","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는데","audio":"/audio/38bceaf18f2d7fee5937.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cd98cb9b809dd041","term":"주방","zh":"厨房","audio":"/audio/cd98cb9b809dd04158c4.mp3","entryId":"25953","definition":"烹制菜肴饭食的地方。","pronunciation":["주방"]},{"id":"0